{"c":"453006","n":"BYSTŘICE 5 P","t":"P","s":"VČ","o":"Miletín","url":"453006-bystrice-5-p","stav":"2026-10-03","popis":"Od mostu u farmy statku Dolenec až k pramenům. K revíru patří:\nnádrž na Borku\tv k. ú. Miletín\t0,1 ha\n(GPS 50°26'20.331\"N, 15°39'5.532\"E)\nPřítoky jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán. V horním úseku Bystřice 5 od Bystrého mlýna po obec Vidonice (Brudu) je chráněná rybí oblast – lov ryb zakázán – vyznačeno tabulemi.\n\n**Na vyznačeném trdlišti lipana podhorního je zákaz brodění od 16. 4. 31. 5.**","delka":15,"rozloha":8,"lat":50.423256,"lon":15.665225,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/miletin","mo_tel":"604 807 460","mo_mail":"polackovi.miletin@centrum.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":70,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-09-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Losos obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true